  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 335727bc8bac9154fa23e07818cc8cdd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GrandmasHouse::GrandmasHouse.UI.StoryCard
  opening: 'The plant closed in March, and the rent kept coming.


    When the lawyer
    called about Grandma''s place in Star Valley (paid off, empty since she passed),
    there wasn''t much to decide. You packed what fit in the car and left the city
    behind.


    The garden''s gone to weeds and the pantry is thin. Winters here
    don''t forgive.


    But it''s yours.'
  openingSeconds: 14
  springSeconds: 10
